---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
import { formatDate, getPosts, postUrl } from '../lib/posts';

const posts = (await getPosts()).slice(0, 3);
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="hero-kicker">Aerospace engineering · Seoul</p>
      <h1>hojun<span>.</span><br />yoo</h1>
      <p class="hero-summary">
        반갑습니다, <strong>유호준</strong>입니다. 궤도역학과 우주추진을 공부하고,
        이곳저곳 여행하며 사진 찍는 것을 좋아합니다.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a class="button-link primary" href="/about/">더 알아보기 →</a>
        <a class="button-link" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="orbit-mark" aria-label="궤도를 형상화한 그래픽">
      <span class="orbit-object"></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="recent-posts">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="recent-posts">최근 글</h2>
      <a href="/posts/">모든 글 →</a>
    </div>
    {posts.length ? (
      <ol class="post-list">
        {posts.map((post) => (
          <li>
            <a class="post-entry" href={postUrl(post)}>
              <span>
                <span class="post-title">{post.data.title}</span>
                {post.data.tags.length > 0 && (
                  <span class="post-tags">{post.data.tags.join(' · ')}</span>
                )}
              </span>
              <time datetime={post.data.date.toISOString()}>{formatDate(post.data.date)}</time>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    ) : (
      <p class="empty-state">
        글을 옮길 준비가 끝났습니다. <code>src/content/posts</code>에 기존 Markdown 파일을 넣으면 여기에 자동으로 표시됩니다.
      </p>
    )}
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
